<!-- EPUB/text/ch001.xhtml -->
<div id="inline-markup" class="section level1 unnumbered">
<h1 class="unnumbered">Inline markup</h1>
<p>Plain, <em>emphasized</em>, <strong>strong</strong>, <strong>bold</strong>, <span style="text-decoration: underline">underlined</span> and <del>struck</del> runs.</p>
<p>Water is H<sub>2</sub>O and the area is r<sup>2</sup>.</p>
<p>A “quotation ‘inside’ another” alternates its marks.</p>
<p>Code faces: <code>literal</code>, <code>ls</code>, <code>/etc/hosts</code>, <code>strlen</code>, <code>Widget</code>, <code>PATH</code>, <code>--verbose</code>, <code>done</code>, <code>MAX</code>, <code>count</code>, <code>&lt;br/&gt;</code>, and <code>(...)</code>.</p>
<p>Fill in &lt;name&gt; and maybe [a flag].</p>
<p>A <em>lingua franca</em> and a <em>word</em>.</p>
<p>A bare phrase carries nothing extra.</p>
<p>Press <span class="keycombo">Ctrl+C</span> or pick <span class="menuchoice">File &gt; Save</span>.</p>
<p>An <span id="spot"></span>anchored spot.</p>
</div>
